{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"She can't quite read the room, but she puts some faith into them \"We got a voodoo doll of everyone that was in the room last night pinned to a board that we commonly go past with a receipt to room 41.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T19:55:10.404000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870756428405678081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"They look at eachother in alarm. \"Room 41 was empty last night, how would they have.... I'll speak to my staff. My most sincere apologies!\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T19:56:58.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870756883114373220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"The security guard remains silent, thinking.","created_at":"2021-07-30T19:57:25.155000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870756993592336414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"\"Perhaps the one you spoke of last night is to be blamed...\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T19:58:11.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870757188858171442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"\"You don't need to apologies as I understand this is something that was not meant to happen. But I do ask\" She leans slightly with a calm tone. \"Please let us in on a little more information from your side. What might be possible causes for this to happen or loopholes that could let things past your magic. I will make an agreement to not share this information with anyone if you would let me. Like I said last night, there is a murder out there and I am trying to figure out why these things are happening and hope that these aren't tied together. Until then, I have to assume they are\" She gives a stern face.","created_at":"2021-07-30T20:00:26.258000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T20:01:07.357000Z","id":"870757753193394186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"\"Ive told you all I know of her already! But we do feel badly for the... inconvenience this has all caused. May I suggest we contact you when she books with us again?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T20:03:01.884000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870758405936128040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"\"In the mean time I will do a thorough investigation into the events of last night and turn over any of our findings to you, expecting utmost secrecy in return?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T20:04:03.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870758666104610876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"852744696979128330","content":"\"That sounds fair, and I do promise to not share this information with anyone other then the member that were involved last night. We are all lamplighters and they would be helpful in solving this faster. But I do want to ask, is there a way to let us talk among ourselves outside of here about the events? I understand we signed our in an agreement, but these things make that agreement... complicated\" She leans back calmly again. \"But I do promise we would only be discussing this within our office as we also don't want to share this with anyone else.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T20:07:32.066000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T20:08:03.382000Z","id":"870759539161563187","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
